  "name": "Cinnamon-Apricot Trail Mix",
  "subtitle": "A quick blend of popcorn, fruit, seeds, walnuts, and warm spice",
  "description": "Combine crunchy popcorn and walnuts with sweet dried apricots, toasted seeds, and cinnamon for a simple single-serving snack.",
